  "description": "Replacement of the front boundary masonry wall with metal railings. Landscaping to front garden. Replacement of the rear external stairs connecting the garden with the upper ground floor. New balcony connecting the external stairs with the upper ground floor. Installation of rear bi-folding doors to the upper ground floor.",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;Prior to the first use of the upper floor balcony hereby approved, the 1.7 metre high screening as shown on the approved drawings shall have been installed and shall thereafter be maintained in perpetuity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;REASON: To safeguard neighbouring amenity.&lt;/p&gt;",
    "<p>The Development hereby permitted shall only be carried out and completed strictly in accordance with the submitted plans hereby approved and any subsequent approval of details.\r\n</p><p><br></p><p>\r\nREASON: To ensure that the development hereby permitted is carried out in full accordance with the plans hereby approved.\r\n</p>",
    "<p>The development hereby permitted must be begun not later than the expiration of three years beginning with the date of this permission.</p><p><br></p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\nREASON: In order to comply with the provisions of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 (as amended).</p><p>\r\n</p>",
    "&lt;p&gt;All new works in respect of all the works hereby approved (and any other incidental works to be carried out in this connection) shall match the existing building in respect of materials used, detailed execution and finished appearance.\r\n\r\n&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;REASON: To ensure a satisfactory external appearance.&lt;/p&gt;"
